  "description": "<p>Analysis code for the article <em>Carrying specific HLA alleles decreases the chance of reaching healthy old age</em> (npj Aging, 2026). The repository contains the HLA imputation pipeline (HIBAG), the per-allele regression and linkage disequilibrium computation, and the script that produces the figures and tables of the article.</p>",
